        81.86609649658203,
        655.3327026367188,
        526.6198120117188,
        665.836669921875
      ],
      "text": "financial incentive and transport fees); psychological support; tracers such as home visits or digital health communications (e.g. SMS,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        664.9327392578125,
        526.6056518554688,
        675.4367065429688
      ],
      "text": "telephone calls); medication monitor; and staff education. The interventions should be selected on the basis of the assessment of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
