    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        674.53271484375,
        354.87420654296875,
        685.0366821289062
      ],
      "text": "individual patient’s needs, provider’s resources and conditions for implementation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.7675170898438,
        526.5927124023438,
        697.4714965820312
      ],
      "text": "Suitable treatment administration options include various forms of treatment support, such as video-supported treatment and regular  63",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        696.5674438476562,
        238.24851989746094,
        707.0714111328125
      ],
      "text": "community or home-based treatment support.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.80224609375,
        429.22149658203125,
        719.5062255859375
      ],
      "text": "Tracers refer to communication with the patient including via SMS, telephone (voice) calls, or home visit.  64",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        718.2369995117188,
        526.7692260742188,
        731.94091796875
      ],
      "text": "A digital medication monitor is a device that can measure the time between openings of the pill box. The medication monitor may have  65",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.994548320770264,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        731.0369262695312,
        487.0791320800781,
        741.5408935546875
      ],
      "text": "audio reminders or send an SMS to remind patient to take medications, along with recording when the pill box is opened.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.271728515625,
        526.6103515625,
        753.9757080078125
      ],
      "text": "Material support can be food or financial support such as: meals, food baskets, food supplements, food vouchers, transport subsidies,  66",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        753.0717163085938,
        526.6097412109375,
        763.57568359375
      ],
      "text": "living allowance, housing incentives, or financial bonus. This support addresses indirect costs incurred by patients or their attendants",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        762.6716918945312,
        467.6470642089844,
        773.1756591796875
      ],
      "text": "in order to access health services and, possibly, tries to mitigate consequences of income loss related to the disease.",
